        <div>
          <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">980-710-25, "Accounting for the Effects of Certain Types of Regulation" contains discussion of the regulatory accounting implications</span>
